{"title":"Operations Analyst Roadmap","role":"Operations Analyst","summary":"An Operations Analyst uses engineering, statistics, business analysis, and data-driven problem solving to improve how an organization operates.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Industrial Engineering & Management"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Operations Analyst uses engineering, statistics, business analysis, and data-driven problem solving to improve how an organization operates."},{"type":"p","text":"The role focuses on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Analyzing operational data and KPIs"},{"text":"Identifying bottlenecks and inefficiencies"},{"text":"Improving processes and workflows"},{"text":"Forecasting demand and capacity"},{"text":"Optimizing manpower, inventory, and resources"},{"text":"Reducing cost, waste, and cycle time"},{"text":"Building dashboards and management reports"},{"text":"Supporting continuous improvement initiatives"},{"text":"Using simulation, optimization, and analytics for decision-making"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Industrial Engineering & Management is a strong foundation because it combines engineering systems + operations management + quantitative analysis."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build industrial engineering, statistics, Excel, SQL, Power BI and process-analysis skills; enter as Operations Analyst/Business Operations Analyst/Process Analyst."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Operations Analyst, Operations Excellence Analyst, Supply Chain Analyst or Process Improvement Specialist."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Move into Operations Manager, Continuous Improvement Manager, Operations Excellence Lead or Analytics Manager roles."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},